c column, and prediction markets put Horsford's chances near 96 to 99 percent.\n\nMoney tells a similar story: Horsford has raised about $3.35 million and holds $1.5 million on hand, while Republican Cody Whipple has raised roughly $885,000. Whipple has campaigned on border security and election integrity, but there is little evidence of a competitive race so far. Horsford is a clear favorite, with the remaining uncertainty stemming from the absence of polling rather than any specific sign of trouble.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9628, "margin": 12.37}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9577, "margin": 12.4}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9584, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9615, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9427, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9481, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9627, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9594, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9636, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9567, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9624, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.96, "margin": 12.3}]}